  "original_sequence_construction": "Retained bus/cafe/office/psquare sequences are unchanged: all four nominal SNR conditions, with the shortest complete utterance repeated once to exceed 20 seconds. Added *_low_snr sequences use the minimum count of distinct, previously unused original utterances at nominal 2.5 dB needed to reach 20-24 seconds (at least four), with both speakers where available. Utterances are ordered by ID and selected before model evaluation. All sequences use 250 ms zero gaps and direct 48-to-16 kHz resampling, without utterance truncation, gain normalization, crossfade, or newly mixed noise.",
